WHAT IS *NOT* CLAIMED: this fills a deadline with a DERIVED bound.  It is NOT
the measurement the design asks for.  The first arm's own D4S_MPIRUN_EPOCH and
first-ExecutionTime delta converts it into a measured value, by the supervisor's
